---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    StateChange[State change transaction]
    Ledger[Outbox event ledger row]
    Delivery[Delivery queue row]
    Dedupe{Dedupe key exists?}
    Ready{Delivery row available now?}
    Claim[FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED over sharded delivery queue]
    Leased[Delivery row with claim_token and future available_at]
    Topology[Declare durable exchange queues and bindings]
    Publish[Persistent mandatory publish with message id]
    Confirm{Broker confirms and routed?}
    Fence{Claim token still current?}
    Published[Ledger published and delivery row deleted]
    Retry[Delivery row with retry delay]
    Stale[Stale publisher result ignored]
    Failed[Ledger failed and delivery row removed]
    Noop[No transition]
    Queue[Message broker]

    StateChange --> Dedupe
    Dedupe -- No --> Ledger
    Dedupe -- Yes --> Noop
    Ledger --> Delivery

    Delivery --> Ready
    Retry --> Ready

    Ready -- Yes --> Claim --> Leased --> Topology --> Publish --> Queue --> Confirm
    Ready -- No --> Noop

    Confirm -- Yes --> Fence
    Confirm -- No --> Retry
    Fence -- Yes --> Published
    Fence -- No --> Stale
    Retry --> Delivery

    Ledger -. Direct administrative update .-> Failed

    class StateChange command
    class Ledger,Delivery,Dedupe,Ready,Claim,Leased,Topology,Publish,Confirm,Fence,Retry,Stale system
    class Published success
    class Failed error
    class Noop component
    class Queue external
